  "title": "Filipino Runner Beans Ginataang Bilo Bilo",
  "description": "A pungent and crumbly Filipino dish featuring runner beans in a rich coconut cream broth, perfect for a crowd, and is shojin-friendly. This dish is a variation of the traditional ginataang bilo bilo, with the addition of runner beans.",
